===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|inorganic compound}} A [[colourless]] or [[white]] [[inorganic]] [[compound]], CaCO{{sub|3}}, occurring as [[chalk]], [[limestone]], [[marble]] etc. Reacts with [[acid]]s to liberate [[carbon dioxide]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|E170}} {{q|when used as a [[food coloring]]}}
* {{l|en|carbonate of lime}}

====Hyponyms====
* {{l|en|aragonite}}
* {{l|en|calcite}}
* {{l|en|vaterite}}

